# The wait's deadline: with a timeout of 2 seconds a command that never exits is waited for two slices, then
# killed, and its code is 128; the record carries the errno the last slice's wait left.
database real
timeout 2
rules tests/corpus/notify/plain.conf
exec * WARNING hang
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
label loop.n kind ssd
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.n v 70
clock 1
pass 1
var loop.n v 10
clock 2
pass 2
clock 3
alarm-log 0
